        "created_at": "2012-04-26T23:25:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think if you’ve spent a lot of time playing Absolute Zero, you’ll have a pretty good idea how heroes dealing damage to themselves in the presence of buffs works.  It really can’t work any other way without destroying his effectiveness.</p>",
